WEBVTT

00:30.767 --> 00:32.448
The air is thin,

00:35.710 --> 00:37.231
my head is tight

00:54.786 --> 00:57.367
Beneath a sharp and western light

00:59.848 --> 01:02.690
A ghost inside this diesel drone

01:04.891 --> 01:07.572
A thousand miles still all alone

01:09.913 --> 01:12.574
The mountain peaks, a jagged crown

01:15.315 --> 01:21.238
In this cold and mile-high town Just wanna drink

01:21.358 --> 01:28.856
a piece of breath But there's a voice inside my

01:28.876 --> 01:36.721
head A mile high, but I'm sinking low A silent no

01:36.941 --> 01:44.006
is all I know My stomach's empty, throat is dry

01:44.046 --> 01:49.930
Beneath the cold Colorado sky And there's a

01:50.050 --> 01:55.914
whisper of a different pain A secret fire, a

01:56.034 --> 02:02.177
burning stain I can't say a word, she'll never

02:02.297 --> 02:09.741
see The pieces that are breaking inside me

02:20.686 --> 02:23.228
Another station, another crowd

02:25.808 --> 02:28.389
Her angry sighs are getting loud

02:30.790 --> 02:33.371
We change the bus a hurried pace

02:35.852 --> 02:38.413
No kindness in this bitter place

02:40.934 --> 02:47.676
I watch the others free to go A life I'll never get

02:47.736 --> 02:54.685
to know Just bite my tongue and play the part

02:56.066 --> 03:03.170
And hide the panic in my heart A mile high, but I'm

03:03.270 --> 03:12.015
sinking low A silent no is all I know My stomach's

03:12.035 --> 03:17.859
empty, throat is dry Beneath the cold Colorado

03:18.019 --> 03:24.003
sky And there's a whisper of a different pain A

03:25.344 --> 03:31.568
secret fire, a burning stain I can't say a word,

03:31.648 --> 03:36.751
she'll never see The pieces that are breaking

03:37.031 --> 03:37.252
inside me

04:01.583 --> 04:03.624
The End

04:21.342 --> 04:29.886
A mile high, but I'm sinking low A silent no is all

04:29.946 --> 04:36.448
I know My stomach's empty, throat is dry Beneath

04:36.568 --> 04:42.992
a cold Colorado sky And there's a whisper of a

04:43.032 --> 04:50.477
different pain A secret fire, a burning stain I

04:50.597 --> 04:56.281
can't say a word, she'll never see The pieces

04:56.341 --> 05:00.845
